# A first page

A page is a file `index.md.j2` (Markdown) or `index.html.j2` (LHTML) in its own directory.
Copy a directory to add a page; its front matter says where it goes in the menu:

```yaml
---
title: A first page        # the title in the menu and in the browser tab
section: Get started       # the section of the menu
group: Basics              # optional: a group inside the section
description: One line.     # optional: the description of the page
---
```

## Headings

The second-level headings of a page are listed in the "On this page" column, on the right
of a wide screen.

## Math

A formula between `\(` and `\)`: \(e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0\).
